    "text": "Bexar County, Texas\nWoman rescues wandering toddler in only a diaper while on routine drive home\n2 hours ago\nSAN ANTONIO — A toddler was found wandering alone with only a diaper, and his mother, 24-year-old Destiny Celaya, bonded out of jail today. Celaya now faces a charge for endangering a child. 24-year-old Destiny Celaya walked out of jail on a 50-thousand-dollar bond from the Bexar County jail today.",
